    (:feature "Section t11: handshake, the client" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 3c314a9; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t12: handshake, the server" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 17fb384; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
